{"id":"7335041040d1b313","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornsat.md","title":"Horn-CNF satisfiability is in P","display":"thm-hornsat — Horn-CNF satisfiability is in P","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornsat","aliases":["27-thm-hornsat"],"display":"thm-hornsat — Horn-CNF satisfiability is in P","depends_on":["[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-hornclause]]","[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-classP]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornsat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornsat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornsat — Horn-CNF satisfiability is in P"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7325f859473bf017\" href=\"?note=7325f859473bf017\" title=\"27-df-hornclause\">27-df-hornclause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7325f859473bf017\" href=\"?note=7325f859473bf017\" title=\"27-df-hornclause\">27-df-hornclause</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65c23d4db160ede7\" href=\"?note=65c23d4db160ede7\" title=\"27-df-classP\">27-df-classP</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\)</span> is the language to be defined over the binary alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encCNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encCNF}\\)</span> is the explicit binary encoding of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>; malformed codes are rejected.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a)=1)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a)=1)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.4.1, Theorems 6.10–6.11，印刷页 282–283，PDF 第 306–307 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对 NULR 的 O(n|η|) 正确性证明与 Horn DNF 补成 CNF 的方向，因此本节点 P 结论有完整多项式算法依据。原书线性 O(n+|η|) 实现的证明留作习题；本节点没有声称已核验该实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclause","status":"resolved","id":"7325f859473bf017","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classP","status":"resolved","id":"65c23d4db160ede7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-classP]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclause","status":"resolved","id":"7325f859473bf017","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ and $\\mathbf P$ are defined in [[27-df-hornclause]] and [[27-df-classP]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-classP","status":"resolved","id":"65c23d4db160ede7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ and $\\mathbf P$ are defined in [[27-df-hornclause]] and [[27-df-classP]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encCNF}$ is the explicit binary encoding of [[27-df-encoding]]; malformed codes are rejected.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HORNSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encCNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\land C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a)=1)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{HORNSAT}\\in\\mathbf P.","display":true}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornsat|thm-hornsat — Horn-CNF satisfiability is in P]]"}],"outgoing":["42004383fb23d1fe","7325f859473bf017","6b749704e82fc727","65c23d4db160ede7","5d10aed668d85817"]}